      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "a:",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Sum still owed by Ab\u016b\u02bel-Bay\u0101n al-J\u0101b\u012b, to the end of Tishri 1495,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;263 3&frasl;4 dir. (Total,) 263 3&frasl;4.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Of it, to his credit: For fastening (the ceiling) in the apartment of Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd, 18 1&frasl;4 dir. Rent, 1/2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Removal of garbage from Shirkat al-Shar\u012bf, 1 1&frasl;2; paper, 3/4; removal of garbage&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;from the funduq, 3&frasl;4. The wife of the Nasi for the month of Tishri, 40. R. Yifta\u1e25&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>for the month of Tishri, 20. A tip, 1 1/3. Night- watch for Rajab, 9 1/2. \u1e24ikr&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;for the small compound adjacent to the (Synagogue of the) Palestinians, to the end of the year [5]79, 6.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Sum still due for the cost of burning oil for the two synagogues, Tishri and Marheshwan, 8.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Paid to al-Naj\u012bb, 1 1/2. Fastening (of the ceiling) ni D\u0101r al-N\u0101g\u012bd, 7 1&frasl;2. D\u0101r b. Pin\u1e25\u0101s, 6.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;For gypsum to Shirkat al-Dayy\u0101n, 31&frasl;4. Remission of rent to b. al-Wazz\u0101n, 3.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;B. al- \u1e24azz\u0101n, to the end of Tishri, 44. Ben Y\u014dn\u0101, 6 &frac12;. Ben al-Raqq\u012b, 17.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Paid to b. al-Mu\u02bfallima, of it, 3. Al-Shar\u012bf, 12 1&frasl;2. The brother of Hiba, 7 1&frasl;4.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Total, 217 3&frasl;4. Sum still owed by him, 46. Also owed by him, for the brother of Hiba,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;7 1&frasl;4 and from b. al-\u1e24azz\u0101n, 11, an error of one month.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Total, 64 1/4, and al-Shar\u012bf, 12 1/2; (total,) 76 3&frasl;4.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;The account of Ab\u016b\u02bel-Bay\u0101n al-J\u0101b\u012b for the month of Marheshwan 1495, Kislev, and Teveth&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;D\u0101r al-N\u0101g\u012bd, 44 1/2. The apartment of R. Jacob, 27.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
